<!doctype html>
<html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>New device credential</title></head>
<body><main><h1>Copy once to your device</h1>
<p>Account: <strong><%= @stream.account.name %></strong> — stream: <%= @stream.name %></p>
<p>Append-only to this stream. Do not paste it into chat. It cannot read data or act as an agent.</p>
<pre><%= @raw_token %></pre>
<p>POST JSON to <code><%= request.base_url %>/api/v1/streams/<%= @stream.stream_key %>/samples</code> with this token as the Bearer credential.</p>
<%= link_to "Return to controls (token will not be shown again)", stream_controls_path %>
</main></body></html>
